span class="label" data-astro-cid-42eo4xdf>Indoor</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-42eo4xdf> <span class="badge tile" style="background:var(--line-nacht)" data-astro-cid-32e3wwaq> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">                  <path d="M20 14.5A8 8 0 0 1 9.5 4a8 8 0 1 0 10.5 10.5Z"></path>   </svg> </span> <span class="label" data-astro-cid-42eo4xdf>Night</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-42eo4xdf> <span class="badge tile" style="background:var(--line-kinder)" data-astro-cid-32e3wwaq> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">                   <circle cx="12" cy="6" r="2.4"></circle><path d="M9 21v-5H7.5l1.7-4.6A3 3 0 0 1 12 9.5a3 3 0 0 1 2.8 1.9L16.5 16H15v5"></path>  </svg> </span> <span class="label" data-astro-cid-42eo4xdf>Kids</span> </li><li data-astro-cid-42eo4xdf> <span class="badge tile" style="background:var(--line-troedel)" data-astro-cid-32e3wwaq> <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">                    <path d="M4 8h16v11H4z"></path><path d="m4 8 2-4h12l2 4"></path><path d="M10 12h4"></path> </svg> </span> <span class="label" data-astro-cid-42eo4xdf>Bric-a-brac</span> </li> </ul></div> </section> <section class="section" data-astro-cid-w6ymvdtg> <h2 class="gutter" data-astro-cid-w6ymvdtg>Questions</h2>  <div class="body" data-astro-cid-w6ymvdtg> <div class="faq gutter" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4> <details class="q" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4> <summary data-astro-cid-hemr5th4><span data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>Is it actually on?</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">      <path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"></path>               </svg></summary> <p class="meta" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>Every date shows when it was last checked. When the organiser has confirmed it, the date says so. When it isn&#39;t confirmed yet, it says that too.</p> </details><details class="q" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4> <summary data-astro-cid-hemr5th4><span data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>What if it rains?</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">      <path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"></path>               </svg></summary> <p class="meta" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>Most markets go ahead. A cancelled date stays on the page and says cancelled. Indoor markets say indoor.</p> </details><details class="q" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4> <summary data-astro-cid-hemr5th4><span data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>Does it cost anything?</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">      <path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"></path>               </svg></summary> <p class="meta" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>fynda.market is free and has no ads. Most markets are free too; an entry fee is shown on the market&#39;s page.</p> </details><details class="q" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4> <summary data-astro-cid-hemr5th4><span data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>I run a market.</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">      <path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"></path>               </svg></summary> <p class="meta" data-astro-cid-hemr5th4>It&#39;s probably already listed. Claim it to confirm dates, add a photo or cancel a day. Free, no account needed.</p> </details> </div> </div> </section> </main> <footer class="site-footer wrapper" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if> <div class="brand gutter" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if> <a class="mark title" href="/en/" data-astro-cid-qisgtjgl> <img src="/brand/fynda-wordmark.svg" alt="fynda.market" width="1995" height="350" data-astro-cid-qisgtjgl> </a> <p class="meta" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Flea markets, and whether they&#39;re on.</p> </div> <div class="signup gutter" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if> <section class="subscribe subscribe--footer" data-subscribe-block data-astro-cid-7u2mu3qg>  <p class="meta body" data-astro-cid-7u2mu3qg>Every Friday: what&#39;s on this weekend near you.</p> <form class="subscribe-form" action="/n" method="post" data-subscribe data-errors="{&quot;empty&quot;:&quot;Enter your email address so we know where to send it.&quot;,&quot;invalid&quot;:&quot;That doesn't look like an email address. Check it and try again.&quot;,&quot;failed&quot;:&quot;That did not work at our end. Try again, or write to contact@fynda.market and we will add you by hand.&quot;,&quot;offline&quot;:&quot;You seem to be offline. Try again when you are back.&quot;}" data-success="You're on the list. The first one arrives on Friday morning." data-astro-cid-7u2mu3qg>  <input type="hidden" name="path" value="/en/" data-astro-cid-7u2mu3qg> <input type="hidden" name="consent_text" value="Only this newsletter, nothing else, and your address is never passed on." data-astro-cid-7u2mu3qg> <input type="hidden" name="anchor" value="sub" data-astro-cid-7u2mu3qg>    <label class="field" for="sub-footer-region"> <span>Region</span>   <select id="sub-footer-region" name="region" aria-describedby="sub-footer-region-error"> <option value>Anywhere in Switzerland</option><option value="zurich">Zurich</option><option value="basel-stadt">Basel-Stadt</option><option value="vaud">Vaud</option><option value="bern">Bern</option><option value="luzern">Lucerne</option><option value="basel-landschaft">Basel-Landschaft</option><op